   Kerhoulas, Nicholas J., Univ Alaska Fairbanks, Dept Biol \& Wildlife, Fairbanks, AK 99775 USA.
   Kerhoulas, Nicholas J.; Arbogast, Brian S., Humboldt State Univ, Dept Biol Sci, Arcata, CA 95521 USA.},
